<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi{{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for contacting the Qantas Customer Care team about your flight to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
I'm sorry to hear that your preferred meal choice wasn't available on your flight.<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
We want all our customers to have an enjoyable journey when they travel with us.&nbsp; We always do our best to offer our customers a wide selection of meals, as well as balance our commitment to sustainability and waste reduction.<br />
<br />
Our catering teams estimate how many meals we need on each flight. However, on this occasion, our estimates were incorrect, and some customers didn’t get their first choice. I can understand how frustrating that must have been.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If remaining meal was unsuitable: -</em></strong><br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear that your meal was unsuitable for you. If you have specific dietary requirements, you can request a specific type of meal ahead of time.<br />
<br />
Please let our Contact Centre know next time you book with us, and we’ll do everything we can to make there’s a suitable meal available.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that I’ve passed your comments to our catering management for future menu review.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to tell us about your experience and we look forward to welcoming you onboard again soon.</p>
</body>
</html>